from pathlib import Path
import json
base=Path('../launch-kit/templates')
operator='Statement Sense is operated by Sayed Zahur as an independent software project. Contact the operator through the contact options on https://github.com/SayedZahur786. Do not post statements, account numbers or removal codes publicly. This research preview is not a bank, payment provider or financial adviser.'
privacy={
'EFFECTIVE_DATE':'21 November 2026',
'OPERATOR_AND_CONTACT':operator,
'DATA_AND_PURPOSES':'When you choose a PDF, it is uploaded over HTTPS to the application server for extraction and deterministic categorisation. No statement contents are sent to an AI model. The application reads bank labels, transaction dates, descriptions, amounts and summary totals. Account-like number sequences and UPI identifiers in returned descriptions are masked on a best-effort basis; this is not a guarantee that every identifying name is removed. Never upload a document you are not authorised to process. The report is returned to your browser memory. If you join the history interest list, we store your email, signup time and a hashed removal code to handle that request. Aggregate daily counts measure non-demo parses, matched tie-outs and new interest signups. They contain no statement contents or user identifiers.',
'COOKIES_AND_ANALYTICS':'The application does not set an account or advertising cookie. The shared analytics component is installed but disabled; no page-view analytics receiver is enabled. Active report data exists only in this tab’s memory, not local storage. Infrastructure providers may process operational request metadata such as IP addresses and timestamps. We do not use behavioural advertising or sell your financial data.',
'PROCESSORS_AND_TRANSFERS':'Vercel hosts the application and processes uploaded PDFs transiently in server memory. Neon provides the dedicated Postgres database for interest signups, global rate limits and aggregate counts. Hosting and support may process data outside India; the database is configured in Singapore. No data-residency or regulatory certification is claimed. Provider operational logs and backups follow their own retention and security controls. The application does not intentionally log statement text, filenames, email addresses or report contents.',
'RETENTION_AND_SECURITY':'Uploaded PDFs and parsed transaction rows are not written to the application database or file storage. The PDF parser is destroyed after each request and the browser report disappears on refresh or tab closure. Runtime memory reclamation is controlled by the hosting platform, so immediate secure erasure cannot be guaranteed. Interest signups expire after 90 days; a daily cleanup job removes expired rows. Global rate-limit entries expire after two minutes and are cleaned during requests. Aggregate daily counters contain no personal records and remain for product measurement. Access uses server-only credentials and parameterised database queries. No system can guarantee absolute security.',
'RIGHTS_AND_REQUESTS':'Uploading is optional. Explore the synthetic demo without sharing a PDF. Clear an active report with New statement, by refreshing, or by closing the tab. To delete an interest signup, open History early access, expand Remove an interest-list signup and submit your saved removal code. Anyone holding that code can remove the matching signup; keep it private. If you lose it, contact the operator through the profile above without publishing private financial information. We will need to verify your control of the email before acting. Requests for access, correction, deletion or concerns can use the same contact route. Do not send children’s documents; the service is intended for adults.',
'POLICY_CHANGES':'Changes to processing or providers will be reflected here with a revised effective date. Material new uses will require an updated disclosure before activation. Check this page before future uploads.'}
terms={
'EFFECTIVE_DATE':'21 November 2026',
'SERVICE_AND_ACCEPTANCE':'Statement Sense is a research-preview tool that extracts supported text-based HDFC, ICICI and SBI statement layouts into a spending report. By using it you agree to these terms. Synthetic fixtures demonstrate the software but do not establish that every bank-issued layout works. Unsupported, scanned or encrypted PDFs may fail. Always compare results against the original statement.',
'ELIGIBILITY_AND_ACCOUNTS':'You must be at least 18 and entitled to process every document you upload. No financial account or login is created in this preview. An interest-list signup is a request for future product updates, not an active subscription. You are responsible for keeping any removal code private. Do not upload another person’s statement without their authorisation.',
'ACCEPTABLE_USE':'Do not upload malicious or illegally obtained files, try to access another person’s data, bypass limits, overload the service or reverse engineer access credentials. Uploads are limited to 3 MB and 30 pages, and supported reports to 2,000 rows. The shared review queue may temporarily refuse requests. Do not use this preview as the sole basis for tax, lending, payment or investment decisions.',
'CONTENT_AND_IP':'You retain rights in your uploaded documents. You permit transient processing solely to produce your requested report. No ownership of bank trademarks is claimed and no bank endorses this tool. Demo documents are synthetic and are not bank-issued statements. The application’s original source licensing is recorded in the repository; third-party components remain subject to their own terms.',
'PAYMENT_AND_CANCELLATION':'Reviewing one statement at a time is free during this preview. Saved history and multi-bank access are proposed at Rs 199 per month but are not sold or delivered yet. There is no checkout, card collection, automatic renewal, payment processor or charge to cancel. Remove an interest signup at any time with its removal code on the History page. Any future paid product will publish separate purchase, renewal, cancellation and refund terms before taking payment.',
'LIABILITY_AND_DISPUTES':'The service is provided on an as-available basis without a guarantee of accuracy, completeness or uninterrupted availability. Categories and recurring-charge flags are suggestions; a recognised merchant is not proof of a subscription. A matched tie-out checks extracted totals, not authenticity, fraud, tax treatment or financial suitability. Review unverified totals and missing rows yourself. To the extent permitted by applicable law, the operator is not responsible for losses from relying solely on a preview report. Nothing here removes non-waivable consumer rights. Raise concerns with the operator first; applicable law governs disputes and no exclusive court or jurisdiction is asserted.',
'TERMINATION_AND_CHANGES':'We may restrict abusive traffic or suspend the preview to address security or reliability issues. You can stop using it at any time. Refreshing clears the active browser report. Personal information retention and deletion are described in the privacy policy. Changes to these terms will appear here with a revised effective date; review them before using a materially changed service.',
'OPERATOR_AND_CONTACT':operator}
for route,template,values in [('privacy','privacy-policy.md',privacy),('terms','terms.md',terms)]:
 text=(base/template).read_text()
 for key,value in values.items():text=text.replace('{{'+key+'}}',value)
 Path('docs/'+route+'.md').write_text(text)
 blocks=text.split('\n\n');jsx=[]
 for block in blocks:
  if block.startswith('# '):jsx.append('<h1>'+block[2:]+'</h1>')
  elif block.startswith('## '):jsx.append('<h2>'+block[3:]+'</h2>')
  else:
   block=block.replace('https://github.com/SayedZahur786','<a href="https://github.com/SayedZahur786">Sayed Zahur’s GitHub profile</a>')
   jsx.append('<p>'+block+'</p>')
 Path('app/'+route).mkdir(exist_ok=True)
 Path('app/'+route+'/page.tsx').write_text('export default function Page(){return <main id="main" className="content-page">'+''.join(jsx)+'</main>;}\n')
